{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/88456-ideas-and-comments-welcome","id":88456,"title":"Ideas and comments welcome.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-10T15:23:41-07:00","id":88456,"title":"Ideas and comments welcome.","content":"So I'm running a new game of Scion (the last one was the first game I ever ran and that was about 5 years ago) and I've got 4 player from different pantheons and after a long internal struggle I figured out what the first main plot was going to be and off we went. I've run into a bit of a bind though and I was wondering how you all handle keeping a very mixed band together after the first &quot;mission&quot; without constant messages from their parents? Or railroading them together? They all live in different places across the country (scion of Manannan Mac Lir is from Washington DC, Scion Of Odin is from Seattle, Scion of Coyote is from Arizona [and still 17], and Scion of Anubis is from Baltimore) and I'm wondering how to keep them together in the long run but not stifle them with divine to do lists from their Dad's...<br /> <br /> Current situation if its useful:<br /> Odin gathered Coyote and Mac Lir to assemble a band to do secret work on a plan that Odin has to dupe Fate out of commencing Ragnarok. First mission assemble at Grand Canyon to find a lost temple of Thoth to gather intel on his ex-wife Ma'at (One of the first godly incarnations of Fate in my version. All divine incarnations of Fate seem to slip out of reach of normal gods very quickly so as not to disrupt the threads of fate around them). While in the temple a Scion of Anubis shows up cause there is a ghost problem and dad wanted it cleaned up so he could get back to weighing those souls. As a side note Loki had a Scion in the general vicinity as well to figure out what Odin is up to and the band has already pissed her off before finding the temple. When they find everything in this massive temple that they need they will exit and find their mortal contact with their Dad's is already dead (killed by the Scion of Loki after she got all the info out of him).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Every normal man must be tempted at times to spit upon his hands, hoist the black flag, and begin slitting throats.&quot;<br /> -H.L. Mencken","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2486-irisheathen","name":"Irisheathen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2486_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T17:57:18-07:00","id":88530,"title":"","content":"I've found that nothing binds a band together like vengeance. Have that scion of Loki do something to mess with each of their lives out of spite. Once they figure out it's her they'll join forces just to take her down. HARD. You can then throw them random missions to distract them from the chase.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T12:26:19-07:00","id":88987,"title":"","content":"I just had an NPC hire them and lavish money and resources on them, let them follow up their own things and, very occasionally, ask them to do something to earn all that. <br /> <br /> Strangely, they are totally accepting of that.... There were a few &quot;what are these people up to and is it a good thing?&quot; qualms at the beginning, but it's amazing what good customer service will smooth over.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T13:13:14-07:00","id":89003,"title":"","content":"Nice ideas, thxs!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Every normal man must be tempted at times to spit upon his hands, hoist the black flag, and begin slitting throats.&quot;<br /> -H.L. Mencken","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2486-irisheathen","name":"Irisheathen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2486_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}